# Accepted dependency vulnerabilities, with reasoning and a review date.
#
# Every entry below is in starlette and every fix requires starlette 1.x.
# FastAPI 0.142.2 requires starlette <1.0, so adopting any of these fixes means
# waiting for FastAPI to support the 1.x line. None affects this application.
#
# Review: 2026-12-31, or whenever FastAPI supports starlette 1.x.
#
# Mirrors .trivyignore at the project root, which covers the same issues as the
# two CVE ids Trivy reports them under.

# URL reconstruction from the Host header. This API is reached only through the
# cluster Ingress, which sets the Host, and no code here builds URLs from it.
PYSEC-2026-161

# request.form() size limits ignored for x-www-form-urlencoded bodies.
# Every endpoint accepts JSON only; there is no form parsing in the application.
PYSEC-2026-249

# HTTP request path not normalised before routing. All routes here are explicit
# and there is no path-based authorisation to bypass.
PYSEC-2026-248

# StaticFiles UNC path handling on Windows. StaticFiles is not used - the
# frontend is a separate nginx container - and this runs only in Linux images.
PYSEC-2026-2281

# Related StaticFiles dispatch issue, same reasoning as above.
PYSEC-2026-2280
